{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "f89c017f2b068be7d7f43abb4d5277d8cc666f2abeb5f204eadf95950258301d", "ja": "魅裏怨 -てんこうせい-", "zh": "魅里怨──转学生", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "158a32ffbd80c0d11e711a0a3499e4bbdcb707f2fe88f9269518ddb7a3fca48d", "ja": "廊下で可奈がぶつかったのは、美奈子のクラ\nスの転校生・可憐。季節外れの転校生にワク\nワクする可奈に、やってきた美奈子はお手製\nのプチシューを渡す。美奈子の様子がどこか\nおかしい事に気付き、疑問を抱く可奈。", "zh": "可奈在走廊上撞到美奈子班上的转学生可怜。\n面对在这种奇怪时机转来的转学生，\n可奈感到兴奋不已。\n美奈子前来将手工小泡芙交给可奈。\n察觉美奈子有异状，令可奈心中不禁有所疑惑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "994a82036b8fb73023d47ad40b5182b006d5dce30e4e238daeb5dbf06c1f0b03", "ja": "はれっ？　ここは音楽室……？", "zh": "咦？这里是音乐教室……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "3fad772921867aa6fb477e21bf16b980e9353ece0e4b8ae5c464949a1d524ebd", "ja": "吹奏楽部の練習中かなぁ？\nでも、いつもの音楽室となんか違うような……。", "zh": "管乐社正在练习吗？\n但是跟平常的音乐教室好像不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "0ad3b0a4f64a0382b911684769f7d9091088d59ceb30b016d1ed9ed5d39a6ca0", "ja": "可奈ちゃん。楽譜、落ちたよ。", "zh": "小可奈，乐谱掉啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "f9b494c98ad93efa5d9e0beff483bbd3323af00d0e9fa0e9429b836ac6b672e4", "ja": "えっ！？　あ、ありがとう……。", "zh": "咦！？谢、谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "3d7b93a71e2d21bf4a80287c24222057108b4a381872d2a803d55575a40cd9f0", "ja": "一緒に頑張ろうね。", "zh": "一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "26332863570333e360712d00539fbc51e26ca1a93f77d190c91c70c336f178ca", "ja": "今の……誰だったんだろ。楽譜を渡された\nはずなのに、顔もよく見えなかった……。", "zh": "刚才的人……是谁呀？明明从她手上接下了乐谱，\n却连她的脸都看不清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "251dd3ac7b7cf9f6c5443da07fa117cc909c0a670a990becd606f3a2b4ff295b", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……。美奈子さん、ひどいよ。\n今日に限って先に行っちゃうなんて～！", "zh": "呼……呼……美奈子太过分了啦，\n竟然专挑今天不等我就先走～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1008_se", "source_sha256": "bcd10d0a0b3ab766b89f2fea614960c0dc453354f0fb55ee5d1383570bd63212", "ja": "どっしーん！", "zh": "砰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "de252dadd63e49e54d1910356d4bd3849c7c91b115fda4503cf1cacd22cbdd8a", "ja": "あいたたた……。鼻ぶつけちゃった……。\nはっ！　すみません！　大丈夫でしたか？", "zh": "痛痛痛痛痛……撞到鼻子了……\n啊！不好意思！你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "06c479f26fbf1648e044fc7844f170d65f948d0f3034523cda438743cdbe8051", "ja": "こ……こちらこそ……す、すみません……", "zh": "我……我才该道歉……不、不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "a2083f42e5d704efe45ad57a7ddf546eacebae9a9626c869ed82c9db172268a7", "ja": "（見たことない人だ……でも、すっごくキレイな人～。\nこんな人、美奈子さんのクラスにいたかなー……？）", "zh": "（是没见过的面孔……不过她长得好漂亮喔～\n美奈子班上有这号人物吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "291c7eff8332a6b5f9c9d059a675fd12e515e3c5721b06ae0c538a2f621760db", "ja": "……し、失礼……しますね？", "zh": "……那、那我先……告辞啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "73d23ec6c66f67c6aa93916ff8f80f9bc1edd32b44010a2c403e5dd63c74b0b7", "ja": "あ……は、はい。", "zh": "啊……好、好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "b0dec92d97080a51ddf550b745956fcb463223be88e840ac1877f1c0f4c970ba", "ja": "……可奈ちゃん。\nどうかした？", "zh": "……可奈，\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "059c57ec477ad8c9645bf61f53a195a0c655d98c1f9a6274a2f24cfe98584708", "ja": "あっ、美奈子さん！　学校来てたんだ！\nもう、心配したんですよ～。", "zh": "啊，美奈子！你已经到学校了啊！\n真是的，我很担心你耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "74a8600c92ccb2fefc6d365be3925fff518e6405f703e9c535acb48d7dc58b81", "ja": "用事があったから。……言ってなかったっけ？\nとにかく、ごめんね。", "zh": "因为我有事……我没跟你说过吗？\n总之抱歉啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "6772c43da44cade53aafd2c378b71a728e48a990487909a351d344702461ab1d", "ja": "はい……あっ！　そういえば、さっき私が\nぶつかった人、美奈子さんのクラスの人ですか？", "zh": "这样啊……啊！话说回来，\n我刚才撞到的人跟美奈子同班吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "36b794512549ecc39cae4ee917658c5081bb2885c684d9a92b3f2688c6c92d06", "ja": "転校生。\n篠宮可憐ちゃん。", "zh": "她是转学生，\n叫做筿宫可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "473ffe952b26fe2d89922044b849f74691d08c53fbfbe6f31c6c14eeafe09f6d", "ja": "転校生……すごーい！\n転校生って、なんかワクワクしますね！", "zh": "转学生……好棒喔──！\n转学生听起来会让人感觉很兴奋呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "cb2bfc72b8fb5c23d44c68540ec075b7c94352732beac66d7510d1e4d14664ca", "ja": "季節外れの転校生さん～♪\n何かが起こりそうな予感～♪　うふふ♪", "zh": "在奇怪时机转来的转学生～♪\n仿佛会发生什么事的预感～♪呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "2ae9a0ae695520efac0b1df1cb62da89fd0ff0b430b92ac23cf03d02760d5e8f", "ja": "歌……可奈ちゃんの……。", "zh": "可奈的……歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "ab5c35b440eb6d4e86f2e986b6ddf37d7ff4a073d8d4d6d7c413b151ddb17798", "ja": "あ……可奈ちゃん？", "zh": "啊……可奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "047ff0076843a2696f26d61dcf98a57b9fb99ef582f16319f22e7707a3b6680a", "ja": "はれっ？　うるさかったですか～？", "zh": "咦？吵到你了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "fa2a0d359394dcb901b8e473aa45e26f7e9301bced843750e8e663dfcc2ef86a", "ja": "ううん……あ、そういえば。\n可奈ちゃんに、プチシュー作ってきたの。", "zh": "不会……啊，差点忘了。\n可奈，我做了小泡芙要给你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "32d20b00becbda8c9d07984a59850aa2580187a18506f087a845cd40d0cf46f3", "ja": "……渡そうと思って昨日の夜、鞄に入れてきたのに。\nどうして忘れてたんだろ……？", "zh": "……我昨天晚上特地放进书包，打算今天给你的，\n为什么到刚才为止都忘了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "712d4f5dd8b226cbd3be9256b63fbd97bf409b6117def7dfa09379f1f079942e", "ja": "ま、いっか。はいっ、可奈ちゃん。\nこれ食べて、吹奏楽部の練習……", "zh": "算了，来，可奈，\n吃了这个以后，管乐社的练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "3d7b93a71e2d21bf4a80287c24222057108b4a381872d2a803d55575a40cd9f0", "ja": "一緒に頑張ろうね。", "zh": "一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "3d7b93a71e2d21bf4a80287c24222057108b4a381872d2a803d55575a40cd9f0", "ja": "一緒に頑張ろうね。", "zh": "一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "472d3985fe67b0aeecd4c88c0f8c94468086dd3ef3729bc749adcd65b1965612", "ja": "はい！　あっ、授業始まっちゃう！　美奈子さん、\n今日は練習があるから、また明日ね～！", "zh": "好的！啊，要开始上课了！美奈子，\n我今天还要练习，所以明天见啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "d94a704fdbc1259ec61df51cf013ba71b700fbd2ce69ad48bc50e94dd367d0f6", "ja": "全国たいか～い♪　準備はいいか～い♪\n美奈子さんと一緒に～……って、アレ？", "zh": "全国大赛～♪准备好了吗～♪\n跟美奈子一起……咦，奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_02_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "c67424b1d1bce7ed1ce252c6d5c4663dd05d95cc5a7b1ec7f4e43e24399299c3", "ja": "一緒に、って……何？", "zh": "一起……做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
